<urn:anqr:profile-revision:3> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The application denominator, reconciled against the whole legacy application rather than against the part already modelled. Revision 2's forty-four capabilities were correct and incomplete: fourteen behaviours the application demonstrably had were owned by no capability, so at capability level they were invisible." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:profile-revision:3> <urn:usf:predicate:objectiveEvidence> "Reconciliation inputs: 126 legacy store actions over 284 state keys, 185 public API query parameters, 33 payload serialisers, 12 client routes, 4 serverless functions, 1 edge function, an MCP server with two tools one prompt and one resource, 88 locale files of which 86 are locales at 1676 keys each, an installable manifest and a service worker, and a 60 kilobyte published OpenAPI document." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:artefactmetadataembedding> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A whole creation panel and eight API parameters write title, author, copyright, licence, time and custom pairs into the container's own metadata chunks. No capability claimed provenance travelling inside the file." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:accessentitlement> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "The legacy store activates and checks a premium entitlement, carries a tier, and the creation surface has a request-access route and a tier-gated payload category. No capability claimed tiering." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:advertisingmonetisation> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "Advertising facades, a page ad rail, a gallery interstitial and an allowlisted advertising origin in the delivered header policy. No capability claimed the revenue model of a free product." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:regulatoryconsent> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A consent platform, its autoblocking, a privacy-string stub and four allowlisted consent origins in the header policy. No capability claimed the precondition of the advertising it gates." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:asynchronousrendering> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A dedicated background render function, an animated render queue and a full-render request flag, documented in the published API as an asynchronous helper. No capability claimed the slow path." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:renderedartefactcaching> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A cache store, a declared non-cache parameter set, disabled-store sentinels and a once-only degradation marker. No capability claimed that a public render API is only affordable when cached." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:abusecontrol> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "Per-route rate limiters for the render and agent surfaces, plus declared bounds on overlay bytes, pixels, redirects, frames, duration and payload length. No capability claimed bounding an unauthenticated service." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:accessauditing> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "An audit store, event types, an outcome taxonomy and a route policy, written for authorised and refused requests alike. No capability claimed the record enterprise consumption depends on." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:runtimeobservability> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A seventy-four-file observability package of logging, telemetry and error-reporting facades. The existing performance-budget capability states a budget; nothing claimed emitting what would show the budget was met." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:crawlablepresentation> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "An edge function injecting per-page metadata, canonical URLs, alternate-language links and preview images ahead of the static response. Multilingual discoverability claims localised pages are findable; nothing claimed the mechanism that makes a client-rendered application readable at all." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:installableoffline> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "An installable application manifest with display, scope and orientation, and a service worker in the built output. Responsive web delivery claims the browser; nothing claimed the installed, network-less case." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:geolocationassistance> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A place lookup and a plus-code display in the location payload panel, consulting a service outside the product. No capability claimed it, and it is the product's only external service dependency in the creation path." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:controlsurfacesearch> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "A search provider, context and label highlighting inside the creation feature, over a surface of 185 parameters. Multilingual discoverability is about search engines; nothing claimed a user finding a control." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
<urn:anqr:delivery-capability:deviceimagecapture> <urn:anqr:predicate:denominatorChangeReason> "Camera acquisition in both the creation overlay picker and the analysis input cards, with downscaling and three distinct classified refusal causes. Shared by two features, so it belongs to neither." <urn:anqr:graph:profile-revision-3> .
